  "code" : "public int numberOfSubstrings(String s) {\n    int[] last = new int[]{-1, -1, -1};\n    int count = 0;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n        last[s.charAt(i) - 'a'] = i;\n        if (last[0] != -1 && last[1] != -1 && last[2] != -1) {\n            int minLast = Math.min(last[0], Math.min(last[1], last[2]));\n            count += 1 + minLast;\n        }\n    }\n    return count;\n}",
